{"seq":3,"slug":"export-documentation-enduse","title":"出口单据与最终用途声明：EUS、记录留存与审计证据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-sanctions-denied-party-screening/export-control-classification/export-documentation-enduse","wordCount":2883,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"出口单据与最终用途声明-eus-记录留存与审计证据\">出口单据与最终用途声明：EUS、记录留存与审计证据</h1><p>一笔从深圳仓发往汉堡的 Wi-Fi 6 网关订单被海关抽中，问的不是「这件货是什么」，而是「你凭什么知道汉堡那个收货人不会把它转口到德黑兰」。ECCN 归类与许可判定回答的是「能不能发」，而这条问题的答案不在货里，在<strong>单据</strong>里：一份把最终用户、最终用途、禁止转口承诺写进可核查字段的最终用途声明（End-User Statement，EUS），加一套能在事后重建当次判定的记录留存体系。本篇拆解这三个对象的字段结构、法域时间线与工程落地，是本章「出口管制与物项分类」中许可判定链条的下游收口环节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-eus-是-承诺-可核查字段-的合取契约\">核心概念：EUS 是「承诺 + 可核查字段」的合取契约</h2><p>跨境团队最常见的误解，是把 EUS 当成「客户签个字就完事的一页纸」。真正在 BIS 稽查或海关质疑中站得住的 EUS，是一份<strong>合取契约</strong>：三种功能缺任一即失效——法律承诺（最终用户签字承诺不转口、不用于 WMD 等被禁用途）、事实声明（最终用途与最终用户身份）、可核查线索（声明能被系统对照其他单据交叉验证）。一份无法与任何其他数据交叉验证的 EUS，在证据法意义上等于零。</p>\n<p>因此工程上的正确定位是：<strong>EUS 是数据契约，签字只是它的生效条件之一。</strong> 判定的合取逻辑可以写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EUS-valid</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mo>∧</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>∧</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>∧</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EUS\\text{-}valid} = C*{sig} \\wedge C*{fields} \\wedge C*{cross} \\wedge C*{sanctions}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EUS</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">valid</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oss</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{sig}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为签署完备（授权人、日期、抬头）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{fields}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为必填字段非空且格式合法、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{cross}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为与发票/提单/订单的一致性强校验通过、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{sanctions}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为签署方不命中受限方清单。任意一条为假，EUS 即不可用于放行。注意先后关系：<strong>先做受限方筛查再做 EUS 归档</strong>，否则一份由受制裁实体签署的「合规声明」本身就是更严重的红旗（见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../denied-party-screening-engineering/screening-pipeline-architecture\">筛查流水线架构</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"eus-的字段解剖-把-最终用途-翻译成可校验结构\">EUS 的字段解剖：把「最终用途」翻译成可校验结构</h2><p>自由文本的「用途说明」不可校验、不可聚合、不可审计。可用的 EUS 必须把用途拆成<strong>枚举 + 定量</strong>两类字段。下表给出最小可用字段集及校验口径，可映射为筛查系统的 <code>end_user_statement</code> 表结构。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>校验口径 / 红旗</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>end_user_legal_name</code></td>\n<td>最终用户法人全称</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>与工商登记一致；与提单收货人可比对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>end_user_address</code></td>\n<td>注册地址</td>\n<td>structured</td>\n<td>与提单/发票地址字段级比对，允许别名映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ultimate_consignee</code></td>\n<td>最终收货人</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>若与最终用户不同，须解释中间环节并同样筛查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>end_use_category</code></td>\n<td>用途类别</td>\n<td>enum</td>\n<td>企业自用 / 集成再售 / 研发测试 / 政府军用 / 其他；<strong>军用与政府用途自动升级人工复核</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>end_use_description</code></td>\n<td>用途描述</td>\n<td>text</td>\n<td>自由文本仅作补充，不作判定依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>quantity_and_value</code></td>\n<td>数量与价值</td>\n<td>numeric</td>\n<td>与订单/发票一致；异常放大触发问询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>country_of_ultimate_destination</code></td>\n<td>最终目的地国</td>\n<td>ISO 3166-1 alpha-2</td>\n<td>与订单目的国比对；不一致即红旗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>no_re_export_clause</code></td>\n<td>禁止转口条款</td>\n<td>bool + text</td>\n<td>必须含标准条款文本，见下文 DCS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>signatory_name_title</code></td>\n<td>签署人姓名与职务</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>需为有权代表该法人的主体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>signature_date</code></td>\n<td>签署日期</td>\n<td>date</td>\n<td>须早于发运日；晚于发运日的 EUS 无效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>设计上一条硬规则：<strong><code>end_use_category</code> 是枚举而非自由文本，因为枚举才能驱动下游分支。</strong> 当类别为「政府/军用」时，系统应自动叠加 Part 744 的最终用途管制判定，并阻断默认的许可例外路径——这与 <a href=\"license-determination-deemed-export\">许可判定引擎</a> 中「实体清单命中通常切断所有例外」是同一套从严逻辑。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[订单创建&lt;br/&gt;收货人/目的国/品类] --&gt; B[受限方筛查]&#10;  B --&gt;|命中| X[阻断并转人工]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| C[生成 EUS 模板&lt;br/&gt;按品类/目的国选模板]&#10;  C --&gt; D[客户回签&lt;br/&gt;填写用途类别与禁止转口条款]&#10;  D --&gt; E{字段级校验}&#10;  E --&gt;|缺项/日期倒挂| C&#10;  E --&gt;|通过| F[与 PI/CI/PL/BL 交叉比对]&#10;  F --&gt;|地址/主体/目的国不一致| X&#10;  F --&gt;|一致| G[绑定许可证/例外&lt;br/&gt;写入放行记录]&#10;  G --&gt; H[归档: 单据包 + 判定快照&lt;br/&gt;保存期 t_export + 5y]&#10;  H --&gt; I[审计可重建]\">flowchart TD\n  A[订单创建&lt;br/&gt;收货人/目的国/品类] --&gt; B[受限方筛查]\n  B --&gt;|命中| X[阻断并转人工]\n  B --&gt;|通过| C[生成 EUS 模板&lt;br/&gt;按品类/目的国选模板]\n  C --&gt; D[客户回签&lt;br/&gt;填写用途类别与禁止转口条款]\n  D --&gt; E{字段级校验}\n  E --&gt;|缺项/日期倒挂| C\n  E --&gt;|通过| F[与 PI/CI/PL/BL 交叉比对]\n  F --&gt;|地址/主体/目的国不一致| X\n  F --&gt;|一致| G[绑定许可证/例外&lt;br/&gt;写入放行记录]\n  G --&gt; H[归档: 单据包 + 判定快照&lt;br/&gt;保存期 t_export + 5y]\n  H --&gt; I[审计可重建]</pre><h2 id=\"记录留存-三个法域的时间线与-保留什么-的口径\">记录留存：三个法域的时间线与「保留什么」的口径</h2><p>出口管制的记录留存不是「把文件扫进网盘」，而是<strong>按法域分别定义保留对象与保留期</strong>。跨境电商同时受多个法域约束（发货地、平台注册地、目的国），因此留存策略必须是「取最严者」的并集。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法域</th>\n<th>主要依据</th>\n<th>保留对象</th>\n<th>保留期起算</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美国 EAR</td>\n<td>15 CFR Part 762（§762.6 保留期）</td>\n<td>出口记录、许可/例外依据、EUS、通信与判定依据</td>\n<td>自出口之日起 5 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国 ITAR</td>\n<td>22 CFR Part 122（§122.5 记录）</td>\n<td>军品出口与转移记录、授权文件</td>\n<td>自出口/转移之日起 5 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>双用途条例 (EU) 2021/821 第 27 条</td>\n<td>出口登记簿、许可、EUS 类文件</td>\n<td>自出口发生年度的年末起不少于 5 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>《出口管制法》(2020-12-01 施行)、《两用物项出口管制条例》(国务院令第 792 号，2024-12-01 施行)</td>\n<td>合同、发票、最终用户与最终用途证明、许可文件</td>\n<td>法令要求保存相关文件不少于 5 年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>留存期的工程表达是一条必须落到<strong>每一条记录</strong>上的到期计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">J</mi></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t*{expire}^{(r)} = t*{export}^{(r)} + \\Delta*{retention}, \\qquad \\Delta*{retention} = \\max\\_{j \\in \\mathcal{J}} \\Delta_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1324em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1324em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1847em;\">J</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{J}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7805em;vertical-align:-0.0972em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1847em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span> 是该笔交易触及的法域集合。<strong>不要用「公司统一归档 5 年」这种全局常量</strong>——ITAR 类交易触及的法域不同、起算口径（出口日 vs 年末）也不同。这要求归档记录携带 <code>jurisdictions[]</code> 字段，而不是一个布尔值。</p>\n<p>第二条硬规则：<strong>留存对象是「判定快照」，不只是「单据原件」。</strong> 单据原件能证明「当时提交了什么」，证明不了「当时系统为什么放行」。归档包至少含四类物：① 业务单据原件（PI/CI/PL/BL/EUS）；② <strong>判定时的规则版本快照</strong>（当时生效的 ECCN 条目、国别表单元格值、清单版本号）；③ 判定输入与输出（筛查输入名称、匹配得分、人工复核意见）；④ 审计事件流（谁在何时改变了记录状态）。缺 ② 则规则事后修订时无法复现判定；缺 ④ 则无法证明记录未被篡改。清单版本化思路与 <a href=\"../sanctions-regimes-lists/list-change-monitoring-delta\">清单变更监测与增量同步</a> 共用同一套机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单据链的交叉一致性-dcs-与-四单一致\">单据链的交叉一致性：DCS 与「四单一致」</h2><p>EUS 从不是孤立文件，它是<strong>单据链</strong>上的一节。BIS 的《了解你的客户》指引（EAR Part 732 Supplement No. 3 红旗清单）强调，红旗往往不在单一文件里，而在文件之间的<strong>矛盾</strong>里。工程上应实现跨单据一致性强校验。</p>\n<p>关键的一节是<strong>目的地管制声明（Destination Control Statement，DCS）</strong>。按 EAR 15 CFR §758.6，受 EAR 管辖物项（除部分 EAR99 输往加拿大等例外）的商业发票与提单上必须载明 DCS 标准文本，核心承诺是：物项仅授权出口至本文件所载最终目的地并供所列最终收货人/最终用户使用，未经美国政府批准不得再销售、转移或处置至其他任何国家或主体。ITAR 物项的 DCS 另见 22 CFR §123.9，措辞更严。<strong>DCS 与 EUS 互补</strong>：EUS 是客户对上游的承诺，DCS 是卖方向下游传递的标记义务——两者字段必须同源。</p>\n<p>四单一致的最小校验集：<strong>订单（PO）→ 形式发票（PI）→ 商业发票（CI）→ 装箱单（PL）与提单（BL）</strong>，逐字段比对收货人名称、地址、目的国、数量、金额。两个常见漏洞：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>转运地伪装为目的国</strong>：目的国填德国，但提单卸货港在阿联酋，且客户历史显示大量同类货物经 UAE 转口。<code>country_of_ultimate_destination</code> 与 BL 卸货港不一致时必须触发最终用户问询，而非自动放行。</li>\n<li><strong>主体别名漂移</strong>：订单收货人、EUS 签署主体、提单通知方是三个相似但字符串不同的名称。字符串不等不等于主体不同，需经<strong>别名映射与主体解析</strong>后再比对；其准确率直接决定一致性校验的误报率，算法细节见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../denied-party-screening-engineering/name-matching-algorithms\">名称匹配算法</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"电商场景的落地-自动生成-强校验与长周期归档\">电商场景的落地：自动生成、强校验与长周期归档</h2><p>跨境电商的合规难点在于<strong>订单量大、单笔低值、客户分散</strong>，逐笔人工准备 EUS 不可持续。可行架构是「模板化生成 + 规则化校验 + 例外人工」：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>模板按品类与目的国分片。</strong> 不同 ECCN 与目的国组合需要不同的 EUS 版本（加密物项往往需额外声明）；模板应是数据（版本化模板库），其变更走与规则变更同一条审批与记录路径。</li>\n<li><strong>校验分两层：阻断级与问询级。</strong> 字段缺项、签署日期倒挂、目的国与卸货港不一致属<strong>阻断级</strong>（不放行）；采购量短期异常放大、首次交易、中间商环节过多属<strong>问询级</strong>（转人工）。把问询级也做成硬阻断会因误报卡死正常业务——与告警分诊中「假阳性代价」是同一取舍，见 <a href=\"../denied-party-screening-engineering/alert-triage-false-positive\">告警分诊与假阳性</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>归档与业务系统解耦。</strong> EUS 归档写入<strong>追加写、不可原地修改</strong>的存储，每条记录携带 <code>jurisdictions[]</code> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{expire}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，由独立任务在到期后才允许清理。切勿把归档做进订单表的一个 <code>attachment</code> 字段——订单被业务性修改或删除时，审计证据随之消失。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对于美国出口并需申报电子出口信息（EEI，通过 AES 提交，见 15 CFR Part 30）的货物，归档包还应保存申报产生的内部交易号（ITN），它是事后核对申报内容与留存单据是否一致的索引键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见缺陷\">常见缺陷</h2><p><strong>缺陷一：EUS 只留 PDF 不留字段。</strong> 扫描件无法参与一致性校验、无法在规则变更后重新评估。口径应是「结构化字段为权威源，PDF 为附件」。\n<strong>缺陷二：把「无需许可证」当作「无需留存」。</strong> 即便判为 No License Required（NLR），判定依据本身（ECCN、国别表版本、筛查结果）仍需留存——NLR 是<strong>结论</strong>，不是留存的豁免条件。\n<strong>缺陷三：保留期用全局常量。</strong> 「全公司统一 5 年」会漏掉起算口径差异与更长保留要求的组合，必须逐笔以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{expire} = t_{export} + \\max_j \\Delta_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计算。\n<strong>缺陷四：判定快照缺失。</strong> 规则事后被修订即无法复现当日判定，审计时只能证明「有文件」而非「判定正确」。这是最致命的一条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>出口单据与最终用途声明的工程本质，是把「合规」从<strong>文件层</strong>上移到<strong>数据与判定层</strong>。EUS 是合取契约（签署 ∧ 字段 ∧ 交叉验证 ∧ 制裁筛查），单据链的一致性校验才是它产生证据力的地方，DCS 把上游承诺传递给下游；记录留存的核心不是「存得久」而是<strong>存得可重建</strong>。判定一条记录是否构成合格证据，判据可收敛为一句话：<strong>给定该记录，第三方能否在不访问你其他系统、不询问当事员工的前提下，独立重建「当次为何放行」的推理链。</strong> 能，即为证据；不能，即只是文件。分类与许可判定回答「该不该发」，单据与留存回答「发了之后你拿什么证明自己合规」。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"出口单据与最终用途声明：EUS、记录留存与审计证据","id":"出口单据与最终用途声明-eus-记录留存与审计证据"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：EUS 是「承诺 + 可核查字段」的合取契约","id":"核心概念-eus-是-承诺-可核查字段-的合取契约"},{"level":2,"text":"EUS 的字段解剖：把「最终用途」翻译成可校验结构","id":"eus-的字段解剖-把-最终用途-翻译成可校验结构"},{"level":2,"text":"记录留存：三个法域的时间线与「保留什么」的口径","id":"记录留存-三个法域的时间线与-保留什么-的口径"},{"level":2,"text":"单据链的交叉一致性：DCS 与「四单一致」","id":"单据链的交叉一致性-dcs-与-四单一致"},{"level":2,"text":"电商场景的落地：自动生成、强校验与长周期归档","id":"电商场景的落地-自动生成-强校验与长周期归档"},{"level":2,"text":"常见缺陷","id":"常见缺陷"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"许可判定引擎：ECCN × 目的地 × 最终用户与许可例外","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-sanctions-denied-party-screening/export-control-classification/license-determination-deemed-export"},"next":{"title":"合规治理基线：内控计划 ICP、角色职责与政策分层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-sanctions-denied-party-screening/screening-ops-disclosure/screening-governance-policy"}}